- @title = 'Platform Engineer · Nitrous'
- @html_class = 'dark'
- @body_id = 'jobs'


.page
  .page-hero
    .container
      = render partial: 'layouts/webnav', locals: { active: 'jobs' }
      .hero-copy
        h2
          | Platform Engineer
        h3
          | San Francisco — Singapore
          
  article.job-listing
    .container
    
      .content
        .job-intro
          h3 We're changing the way the world codes.
          p 
            | The Nitrous platform engineering and devops team works on the infrastructure and tools that power our cutting-edge cloud development platform.
            
        .job-description
          p
            | We're looking for talented engineers who are passionate about building fault-tolerant distributed systems, automating configuration and deployment, and bringing about a level of security to our deployment process which enables our application teams to deploy features quickly and consistently.

          h4 Responsibilities
          ul
            li Implement internal tools such as monitoring, analytics and automated backup in the form of services
            li Be responsible for the uptime of customer-facing services
            li Design and lead infrastructure failure simulations and implement corrective measures
            li Benchmark app performance and design scalable and performant systems and APIs

          h4 Technologies
          ul
            li Go, Bash, Ruby
            li Docker
            li Amazon Web Services
            li Chef, Puppet
            li Vagrant
            li RabbitMQ, AMQP
            li PostgreSQL, Redis, Memcache
            li Nginx, HAProxy
            li Monit, Nagios, Sensu
            li Collectd, Statsd, Diamond, Riemann
            li Graphite, Logstash
            li Git

          h4 To apply, please provide the following:
          ul
            li Resume
            li Github Profile
            li Links to side/hobby projects that you have built
            
      .sidebar
        h4 Perks
        ul
          li Competitive salary &amp; equity
          li Company-covered lunch
          li Health, Vision &amp; Dental Insurance
          li Choice of equipment
          li Flexible vacation
          li Fun company events
          li Referral bonus program
          li SF-Singapore exchange program
        
        a class="btn blue" href="mailto:jobs@nitrous.io?subject=Platform Engineer @ Nitrous"
          | Apply for this position
        
        p.small
          | Nitrous does not accept agency resumes.
          br
          | Nitrous is an equal opportunity employer.



